       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TEST-PROGTIME.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY COD001A.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           INITIALIZE COD001A-REGISTRO
           CALL 'PROGTIME' USING COD001A-REGISTRO
           DISPLAY 'TIME:' COD001A-TIME
           DISPLAY 'PERIOD:' COD001A-PERIODO
           DISPLAY 'RC:' RETURN-CODE
           STOP RUN.
